{"id":"1fdbea0d9f660893","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Weak Convergence Code","display":"df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code — ZFC Measure11 Weak Convergence Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code — ZFC Measure11 Weak Convergence Code","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-weak-convergence-code — ZFC Measure11 Weak Convergence Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> (weak-convergence code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\mu:\\omega\\to V\">\\(\\vec\\mu:\\omega\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (probability-measure sequence and limit probability measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\((\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (topological spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathcal B:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (bounded continuous real-valued test-function family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11WeakConvergenceCode}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11WeakConvergenceCode}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}weak\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}code}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11WeakConvergenceCode}_S(W,\\vec\\mu,\\mu,X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land W=\\langle\\vec\\mu,\\mu,X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},F\\rangle\\land\\vec\\mu:\\omega\\to V\\land\\Bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\vec\\mu(n),X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\Bigr)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\land F=\\Bigl\\{f:X\\to\\mathbb R:\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq C)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|\\int f\\,d\\vec\\mu(n)-\\int f\\,d\\mu\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}weak\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}code}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11WeakConvergenceCode}_S(W,\\vec\\mu,\\mu,X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land W=\\langle\\vec\\mu,\\mu,X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},F\\rangle\\land\\vec\\mu:\\omega\\to V\\land\\Bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\vec\\mu(n),X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\Bigr)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\land F=\\Bigl\\{f:X\\to\\mathbb R:\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq C)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|\\int f\\,d\\vec\\mu(n)-\\int f\\,d\\mu\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is weak convergence of Borel probability measures. The probability restriction makes every bounded test-function integral finite.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375d